# Periodic commit and push

- After completing a logical chunk of work (e.g. a feature, a set of related changes), commit and push.
- Commit message should reference CHANGELOG/version when applicable.
- Remote: `origin` → `https://github.com/XYIANSoftware/swim-with-kholton.git`, branch `main`.
- Do not commit in the middle of broken or half-done work; wait until the change is done and tested.
